# Textures are the bulk of the repo (~55 MB, all actively referenced).
# They are currently stored inline; the repo stays cloneable (< GitHub's
# 100 MB soft limit). If clone size becomes a problem, migrate with:
#
#   git lfs install
#   git lfs track 'textures/**/*.jpg' 'textures/**/*.png'
#   git lfs migrate --include='textures/**' --everything
#
# (Committing this file with lfs filters ACTIVE breaks every commit on
# machines without git-lfs -- hence patterns are documented, not bound.)
*.jpg diff
*.png diff
*.stl binary
*.glb binary
